          -50,
          -60
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "content": "### Private video delivery QA folder\n\nRun this fixture once. It creates one folder in My Drive for the 30 publication workflow tests. No sharing node or notification is configured.\n\nSave the returned folder ID. Do not rerun after success; folder creation is not idempotent. The publication tests will upload videos only to this dedicated folder.",
